OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers will
OL,6,Fclear this evening, leaving the rest
OL,7,Fof the night dry night with lengthy
OL,8,Fclear spells for most. Turning rather
OL,9,Fcold under clear skies and light winds
OL,10,Fallowing for frost to develop in
OL,11,Fplaces.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FA cold, clear start with
OL,14,Ffrost in places. Then remaining dry
OL,15,Fand settled through the day with
OL,16,Fplenty of sunshine but some patchy
OL,17,Fcloud developing for the afternoon.
OL,18,FLight winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
